Muxy Git Graph
==============

This extension is a Muxy port of Git Graph for Visual Studio Code by mhutchie:

    https://github.com/mhutchie/vscode-git-graph

It is an independent project and is not endorsed by or affiliated with mhutchie.

The lane geometry in `src/graph/layout.ts` is ported from `web/graph.ts` of
vscode-git-graph, which is MIT licensed. The upstream licence is reproduced in
`licenses/vscode-git-graph-LICENSE` and its copyright notice is retained in this
project's LICENSE.

Everything else — the data layer, the virtualised view, the styling and the tests —
is written for Muxy and does not derive from the upstream source. See
`docs/adr/0001-rewrite-not-port.md` for why.
